static.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511320/extras/40c64c1b606e9a73d46d037f76fd4b77.webp?t=1749217231\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511320/extras/73800a7d89a1bef7af8074698422ec4c.poster.avif?t=1749217231\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511320/extras/73800a7d89a1bef7af8074698422ec4c.webm?t=1749217231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511320/extras/73800a7d89a1bef7af8074698422ec4c.mp4?t=1749217231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Set out to conquer new cycling races in Tour de France 2025. Discover the Fl\u00e8che Wallonne, the iconic race of the Ardennes triptych, with its mythical finish at the top of the Mur de Huy. Take part in the original Circuit Grand Est race and discover the stages that make it up. Each race offers the opportunity to forge a little more of your legend and strengthen your reputation as a cyclist.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511320/extras/20d7cc4edbefeae93754cce7cf621645.webp?t=1749217231\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511320/extras/d7d35d0eac821dcfecf6f0f0fed71bc7.poster.avif?t=1749217231\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511320/extras/d7d35d0eac821dcfecf6f0f0fed71bc7.webm?t=1749217231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511320/extras/d7d35d0eac821dcfecf6f0f0fed71bc7.mp4?t=1749217231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Addition of 5 online rankings in Criterium mode<br></li><li>New rewards to unlock in Criterium Mode<br></li><li>New Races of the Moment and Descents of the Moment <br></li><li>Redesigned home menu <br></li><li>New graphics options <br></li><li>Added accessibility options for color-blind users<br></li><li>Smoother navigation in the peloton<br></li><li>Reworked sprint AI</li></ul>",
